<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/LDR18-Figure3.13> a ipbes:Figure,
        ipbes:Illustration ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/LDR18-3.5> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Cheatgrass promotes more frequent fire that native perennial shrubs are not able to withstand. Large expanses of the Great Basin ecosystem of the USA have been transformed into cheatgrass monocultures. Copyright © 2015 The Regents of the University of California. Used by permission." ;
