    ipbes:hasDescription "Net change between 1500 and 2000 of within sample species richness is modelled according to an IMAGE 2.6 reference scenario (Hurtt et al., 2011). The baseline landscape was assumed entirely uninhabited, unused primary vegetation. Source: Newbold et al. (2015)." ;
