    ipbes:hasDescription "Countries shown in green are net virtual water exporters; those in yellow and red import virtual water. The biggest net exporters are the USA, Canada, Brazil and Argentina (only flows > 15 billion m3 per year are used in the assessment; the wider the arrow the larger the flow). Source: Hoekstra & Mekonnen (2012)." ;
