    ipbes:hasDescription "Note: (i) light degradation was excluded from the estimates here; and (ii) North America includes Mexico and Central America, unless otherwise noted. Table annotations: a - does not include Caribbean; b - includes some Caribbean countries; c - total based on country areas listed in Bai et al., (2008) and does not match global total listed in the same source (3,506 million ha); d - non-tropical continents not included in this study; e – many inconsistencies in Eswaran et al. (2001) and Eswaran & Reich (1998), between and within each." ;
