<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333076/items/3ZAZ8N9M> a ipbes:Reference ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/LDR18ch1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/LDR18ch6>,
