<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/LDR18-1.4.5.3> a ipbes:SubChapter ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/LDR18ch1> ;
    ipbes:Reference <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333076/items/84AHX2SG>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333076/items/8J3E64N5>,
