    ipbes:hasDescription "The vegetation cover of the Sahel, as observed by satellites and measured by the Normalised Difference Vegetation Index (NDVI), has generally increased over the period 1987 to 2015 (Anyamba & Tucker, 2005; Anyamba et al.," ;
