<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333076/items/FLBXUYGH> a ipbes:Reference ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/LDR18ch3>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/LDR18ch7> ;
    ipbes:Report ipbes:LDR18 ;
