        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333076/items/V3QMVXFR>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333076/items/VKFPW4C3>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333076/items/W5VWEHKC>,
