        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/LDR18-ch1-16>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/LDR18-ch1-50>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/LDR18-ch1-53>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/LDR18-ch1-77>,
